<newsitem itemid="207492" id="root" date="1996-11-21" xml:lang="en">
<title>NETHERLANDS: FREE RECORD 96 PROFIT NLG 11.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>FREE RECORD 96 PROFIT NLG 11.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to September 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    11.3  vs  11.1</p>
<p>    Turnover			     306    vs 285</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    18.0  vs  17.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Free Record Shop said it was still too early to make</p>
<p>a forecast of its results for the year to September 30, 1997.</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.20 vs   3.16</p>
<p>    Dividend* (guilders)		 1.00 vs   same</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     0.63 vs   0.84</p>
<p>    Tax					5.73 vs   5.69</p>
<p>    Third party interests		0.16 vs   nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional expenses		 0.22 vs   0.28</p>
<p>NOTE - In addition to the regular dividend for the 1995</p>
<p>financial year, Free Record Shop paid a bonus dividend of 2.00</p>
<p>guilders per share to mark its 25th anniversary.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
